                    <h2>BeeYarn Refund Policy</h2>
                    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> April 5, 2025 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <strong>Last
                            Updated:</strong> April 5, 2025</p>
                    <p>This Refund Policy applies to all paid services on the BeeYarn platform, including Advertisements
                        and Subscription plans. Please read it carefully before making a purchase.</p>

                    <hr>

                    <h3>1. Advertisements</h3>

                    <h4>1.1 How Ad Payments Work</h4>
                    <p>When you create an advertisement on BeeYarn, you pay upfront for a fixed campaign duration (e.g.
                        7 days, 14 days, 30 days). Your ad runs from your chosen start date until the end date. Payment
                        is processed securely via Paystack.</p>

                    <h4>1.2 When You Can Cancel and Get a Refund</h4>
                    <p>You may cancel an ad at any time while it is in any of the following states:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Pending Review</strong>: submitted and awaiting approval</li>
                        <li><strong>Approved</strong>: approved but not yet active</li>
                        <li><strong>Active</strong>: currently running</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Ads that have already <strong>ended</strong>, been <strong>deleted</strong>: or are in
                        <strong>draft</strong> status cannot be cancelled via this process and are not eligible for a
                        refund.
                    </p>

                    <h4>1.3 How the Refund Amount Is Calculated</h4>
                    <p>Refunds are calculated on a <strong>pro-rata (time-remaining) basis</strong>:</p>
                    <div class="formula-block">
                        Gross Refund = (Remaining Campaign Time ÷ Total Campaign Duration) × Amount Paid<br>
                        Net Refund = Gross Refund − Admin Processing Fee (default 5%)
                    </div>
                    <div class="example-block">
                        <strong>Example:</strong><br>
                        You paid ₦10,000 for a 10-day campaign.<br>
                        You cancel after 3 days (7 days remaining).<br>
                        Gross refund = (7 ÷ 10) × ₦10,000 = ₦7,000<br>
                        Admin fee (5%) = ₦350<br>
                        <strong>Net refund = ₦6,650</strong>
                    </div>

                    <h4>1.4 Minimum Refund Threshold</h4>
                    <p>A refund is only processed if the calculated net refund amount is <strong>₦500 or more</strong>.
                        If the net refund is below ₦500, no refund will be issued and the ad will simply be cancelled
                        without payment.</p>

                    <h4>1.5 Ads That Have Not Yet Started</h4>
                    <p>If you cancel an ad before its start date, the remaining duration is calculated from the current
                        time to the end date, meaning you will receive a refund for nearly the full campaign duration
                        (minus the admin fee), subject to the ₦500 minimum threshold.</p>

                    <h4>1.6 Ads That Have Already Ended</h4>
                    <p>No refund is available for campaigns that have already completed their full run.</p>

                    <h4>1.7 Admin Processing Fee</h4>
                    <p>A non-refundable admin processing fee is deducted from all ad refunds. The default fee is
                        <strong>5%</strong> of the gross refund amount. This fee covers payment processing costs and
                        platform administration. The exact fee percentage in effect at the time of your cancellation
                        applies.
                    </p>

                    <h4>1.8 Refund Method</h4>
                    <p>All ad refunds are returned to the <strong>original payment method</strong> used at checkout (the
                        card or bank account charged via Paystack). Refunds are not issued as BeeYarn credits or Yarn
                        Points.</p>

                    <h4>1.9 Refund Timeline</h4>
                    <p>Once a refund is approved and processed by our system, it is submitted to Paystack immediately.
                        Depending on your bank or card provider, the funds will typically appear in your account within
                        <strong>5–10 business days</strong>.
                    </p>

                    <h4>1.10 No Refunds For</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Ads cancelled due to violations of BeeYarn's Advertising Guidelines or Terms of Use</li>
                        <li>Ads rejected by the moderation team after review</li>
                        <li>Ads that were paused or modified at your own request</li>
                        <li>Performance dissatisfaction (e.g., low clicks, views, or impressions), ad performance is
                            not guaranteed</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr>

                    <h3>2. Subscriptions</h3>

                    <h4>2.1 How Subscriptions Work</h4>
                    <p>BeeYarn subscriptions (Verification / Premium) are billed on a <strong>monthly recurring
                            basis</strong>. Each billing cycle covers one calendar month of access starting from your
                        subscription date.</p>

                    <h4>2.2 Cancellation Policy</h4>
                    <p>You may cancel your subscription at any time. When you cancel:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Your subscription remains <strong>active until the end of your current billing
                                period</strong>: you do not lose access immediately</li>
                        <li>Auto-renewal is disabled so you will not be charged again</li>
                        <li>No partial refund is issued for the remaining days in the current billing period</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4>2.3 No Mid-Cycle Refunds</h4>
                    <p>Subscriptions are <strong>non-refundable for the current billing cycle</strong>. If you cancel on
                        day 5 of a 30-day cycle, you retain access for the remaining 25 days but will not receive a
                        refund for that period.</p>

                    <h4>2.4 Auto-Renewal Failures</h4>
                    <p>If your auto-renewal payment fails (e.g., expired card, insufficient funds):</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>You will be notified immediately via the app and email</li>
                        <li>Your subscription will be marked as expired</li>
                        <li>Auto-renewal will be disabled</li>
                        <li>You will not be charged again until you manually resubscribe with a valid payment method
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4>2.5 Free / Admin-Granted Subscriptions</h4>
                    <p>Subscriptions granted for free by the BeeYarn team (e.g., for promotions, contests, or goodwill)
                        carry no monetary value and are not eligible for any form of refund or cash equivalent.</p>

                    <h4>2.6 Exceptions</h4>
                    <p>Refunds for subscriptions may be considered at BeeYarn's sole discretion in the following
                        exceptional circumstances:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Duplicate charges caused by a technical error on our platform</li>
                        <li>You were charged after clearly and successfully cancelling your subscription</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>To request an exception, contact support within <strong>7 days</strong> of the charge in
                        question.</p>

                    <hr>

                    <h3>3. General Terms</h3>

                    <h4>3.1 How to Request a Refund</h4>
                    <p>For <strong>ad refunds</strong>: Cancel your ad directly from within the BeeYarn app. Eligible
                        refunds are processed automatically. No manual request is needed.</p>
                    <p>For <strong>subscription exceptions or disputes</strong>: Contact our support team at <a
                            href="mailto:support@beeyarn.com">support@beeyarn.com</a> with your account email, the date
                        of the charge, and a brief description of the issue.</p>

                    <h4>3.2 Chargebacks</h4>
                    <p>We ask that you contact us before initiating a chargeback with your bank. Unauthorized
                        chargebacks may result in suspension of your BeeYarn account. If a chargeback is found to be
                        fraudulent, we reserve the right to recover the disputed amount and take further action.</p>

                    <h4>3.3 Changes to This Policy</h4>
                    <p>BeeYarn reserves the right to update this Refund Policy at any time. Significant changes will be
                        communicated via in-app notification or email. Continued use of the platform after changes are
                        published constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

                    <h4>3.4 Governing Law</h4>
                    <p>This policy is governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria. Any disputes shall be
                        resolved in accordance with Nigerian consumer protection law.</p>

